[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e8c\u5341\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_lungmen_b",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loading_intro",
        "key": "$loading_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Franka, Liskarm, be aware of our surroundings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take Misha to Madam Ch'en.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're late again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen doesn't want any more security risks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, our escort team was attacked multiple times by Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "In fact, they're still around as we speak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not safe here. Please take Misha and leave as soon as possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you're Misha?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "From now on, you will follow the L.G.D.'s arrangements.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "PC94172, you're in charge of this girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, I don't know what Lungmen needs her for...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I hope that you can ensure her safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We already treat the Infected very well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I see...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Misha is not in good health.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We hope that Lungmen will allow her to live in Rhodes Island after this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'll send an application to Chief Wei.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen will transfer her to Rhodes Island if she passes our checks with no other issues.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "...That is, if there aren't any problems.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "It shouldn't take long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We'll part ways for the time being, Misha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island welcomes you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, while I'm gone, please protect those kids in the slums.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh, that's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "No problem, you have my promise!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, Misha...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Next time, could you teach me... how to make dolls?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "name2": "char_012_misa_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hehe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm, sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
