    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is our mission over now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island will have their hands tied the more they get dragged into all this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But, Lungmen is still keeping a lot of secrets from us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Lungmen doesn't seem to care about us too much...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the opposite seems to be true for Reunion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "The enemy wants to attack the district we're staying at.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though I've heard about it, Lungmen's architecture sure is complex!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "This entire street is actually built on rooftops...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "...and that's giving our enemies a huge advantage to exploit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion is attacking again...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've even chased us all the way out here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do they... want Misha so badly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
